科学分会委员、呼吸学组副组长，上海医学会变态反应分会委员。专业特长为小儿呼吸系统疾病的规范化诊治，主攻方向为先天性肺病、儿童慢性肺病的分子诊断和临床诊治，儿童变态反应疾病的诊断和防治策略。作为课题负责人先后主持科技部、上海市科委、上海市卫健委基金项目，以第一作者和通讯作者发表论著70余篇，其中SCI收录30余篇，主编《儿童社区获得性肺炎标准数据集》、《儿科住培教学查房和病例讨论精选》。主讲复旦大学五年制大课、八年制翻转课堂、PBL教学，连续多年被评为“优秀授课教师”，先后获得“复旦大学奖教金”、“复旦大学本科教学贡献奖”、“复旦大学优秀党务工作者”、“复旦大学十大优秀医院管理工作者”等奖励。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究方向</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.儿童先天性肺病、儿童慢性肺病的分子诊断和临床诊治；2.人工智能与医学多模态数据的跨学科应用研究</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>导师邮箱</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>zhangxiaobo0307@163.com</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/oFVTh5N36Q3RfibfARBjQMd5c2RIsEAM6mG6MnQEotu2G7ibZ5jUSh4yS3CEtVlk4Via62BrldeWnCvYY0prrU7bdcOiboTGshjg9j40ibgLdSgg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•陈功 博士生导师</span></p><p><span>•复旦大学附属儿科医院普外科诊疗中心主任</span></p><p><strong><span>•招生方向：（儿科医院直博生）儿外科学/肝胆结构畸诊治研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>个人简介</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>教授、博士生导师，复旦大学附属儿科医院普外科诊疗中心主任。担任中华医学会小儿外科学分会肝胆外科学组副组长、中国医师协会小儿外科医师分会肝胆学组副组长、中华妇幼协会胸外微创组全国委员、上海市医学会小儿外科分会委员、上海市医学会内镜分会ERCP学组委员，《临床小儿外科杂志》《中华实用儿科临床杂志》编委，Journal of Pediatric Surgery杂志Publishing Committee成员。长期从事一线临床和教学工作，研究领域为小儿肝胆胰结构畸形的临床与基础研究，医疗专长包括儿童复杂肝胆胰结构畸形的诊断和治疗、微创外科-腹腔镜和达芬奇机器人手术、ERCP技术及内镜治疗，对门静脉畸形及肝移植技术有深入认识。主持国家自然基金、上海市自然基金、上海市科委引导项目等多项课题，第一作者或通讯作者发表SCI论文数十篇。曾获高校科技进步奖二等奖、中华医学奖三等奖、全国小儿外科青年医师手术录像大赛三等奖，获得上海市“医苑新星”杰出青年医学人才计划资助。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究方向</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>肝脏、胆道发育分子机制与先天性肝胆畸形</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>导师邮箱</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>chengongzlp@hotmail.com</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/oFVTh5N36Q2bSWhfIOOzqjQqjOLxibNzOyrZ09VlhjhIwytGour0M3IicHFNWfDyNaFPR8XVpic8YH1YSyib0ZKiaS5lYP9Yb9qcWTRAPNp4TEtQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•董岿然 博士生导师</span></p><p><span>•复旦大学附属儿科医院党委副书记，肿瘤外科学科带头人</span></p><p><strong><span>•招生方向：（儿科医院直博生）儿外科学/肿瘤外科研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>个人简介</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>教授、博士生导师，复旦大学附属儿科医院党委副书记、肿瘤外科学科带头人。现任国家卫生健康委儿童肿瘤专家委员会实体肿瘤组副主任委员、中华医学会小儿外科学会副主任委员、上海市小儿外科学会主任委员、中国抗癌协会儿童肿瘤专业组副主任委员、中国研究型医院学会儿童肿瘤专业委员会副主任委员、上海市肿瘤学会骨与软组织肿瘤学组委员；亚太小儿外科学会（PAPS）会员；国家卫生健康委员会内镜诊疗技术规范化应用小儿外科项目专家组成员、上海市级医院肉瘤临床诊治中心(SSCC)专家委员会委员；中华小儿外科杂志编委，临床小儿外科杂志副主编。研究方向主攻儿童胚胎性恶性肿瘤的规范化综合治疗和手术，擅长神经母细胞瘤、肝母细胞瘤、肾母细胞瘤和各类软组织肿瘤的诊治。开展小儿外科各类腹腔镜手术，对于胆总管囊肿、腹部肿瘤、食道闭锁和重症膈疝等的微创手术治疗有丰富经验。获国家自然科学基金、上海市自然科学基金、上海市卫计委课题等多项研究资助，参与国家十二五科研项目等国家级研究，是教育部重点学科建设和上海市疑难重症诊治中心建设等多项学科建设项目主要成员。近10年来发表64余篇论文，其中SCI论文21篇。研究成果“小儿胚胎性肿瘤的病因探索、流行病调查和治疗策略研究”获国家妇幼健康科技进步奖三等奖，上海市医学科技进步奖二等奖，中华医学科技奖三等奖；作为主要参加者完成的课题“基于小儿肝胆胰计算机辅助手术系统研发、临床应用及产业化”项目，获得2019年度国家科技进步二等奖。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究方向</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>小儿外科胚胎源性疾病（畸形与肿瘤）的发病机制与治疗的研究</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>导师邮箱</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>kuirand@hotmail.com</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/oFVTh5N36Q0K6jicgfToIqiatw0nYgOIUUDxH2iac3KWcD66bibia3eTC5KGvMX7z5S5VyWMYu408ONNh6ODJKZWIoU9Ybtm8XMqBk6GTftcnoYE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•翟晓文 博士生导师</span></p><p><span>•复旦大学附属儿科医院副院长、血液科学科带头人</span></p><p><strong><span>•招生方向：（儿科医院直博生）儿科学/血液系统疾病研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vthMZmIIAicnM9gJBicNNApxH3118u2Z2MAPF2wSfERuibRhP1EN4B7NHy8lTHsCgRPiaSB7XDibRibXG1Yw0VRDD7Hy4YISfDI65bPbbIZe4MRDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>个人简介</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>教授、博士生导师，复旦大学附属儿科医院副院长、血液科学科带头人。担任国家儿科与小儿外科专业医疗质量控制中心副主任、国家卫生健康委儿童白血病专家委员会副主任委员、中国研究型医院学会儿科专委会副主任委员、中国妇幼保健协会脐带血应用专业委员会副主任委员、中国医师协会儿童血液学组副组长、上海医学会儿科分会血液学组副组长、上海市抗癌协会常务理事。致力于儿童血液肿瘤疾病的临床试验和发病机制研究，积极推动造血干细胞移植特别是脐血移植治疗儿科罕见病的工作，研究领域包括儿童血液肿瘤的发病机制和预后因素的研究、造血干细胞移植根治儿科罕见病的队列研究、新型基因编辑技术治疗遗传性血液病的IIT研究；医疗专长包括儿童各类血液肿瘤、各类贫血出凝血疾病的诊断和治疗，以及脐血移植治疗各类儿科罕见病。主持国家自然科学基金、国家重点研发计划子课题、上海市科委重大专项等，以第一或者通讯作者发表论文100余篇。荣获上海东方英才拔尖项目，中国医院协会科技创新奖、宋庆龄儿科医学奖、上海医学科技奖、上海医院管理奖等奖项。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究方向</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><